  "title": "Mesa Labs Announces Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year 2026 Results",
  "summary": "LAKEWOOD, Colo., May 27, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Mesa Laboratories, Inc. (NASDAQ:MLAB) (“Mesa” or “the Company”), a global leader in the design and manufacture of life science tools and critical quality control solutions, today announced results for its fourth fiscal quarter (“4Q26”) and fiscal year (“FY26”) ended March 31, 2026 (amounts in thousands). 4Q26 Financial Summary – (comparisons are versus the same prior year period) Revenues increased 2.6% Non-GAAP organic and core organic revenues 1",
